WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:02.800
Welcome to Centaur.

2
00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:10.410
This short guide walks you through setting up your workspace, so your AI agents can start work, usually within a day.

3
00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:17.460
Everything starts here, on your dashboard. The Get Centaur ready checklist lists every step, in order.

4
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:23.400
Each one ticks itself off when it's done, and the Start button takes you straight to the right screen.

5
00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:29.350
First, add your company details: your name and when your financial year starts.

6
00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:34.510
Then invite your team. Each person gets an email to set their own password.

7
00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:41.610
Next, connect Microsoft 365. This is the one step for your IT admin.

8
00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:46.750
Enter their email address, and Centaur sends them step-by-step instructions.

9
00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:49.180
It takes about twenty minutes.

10
00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:55.120
Centaur also checks your email setup, so your messages land in the inbox, not in spam.

11
00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:03.620
Then connect your own AI key from Anthropic. You pay Anthropic directly, at their rate, with no markup from us.

12
00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:11.320
As soon as the key is saved, every AI agent switches on, in draft mode, so nothing is sent without your approval.

13
00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:14.520
Now teach the AI about your business.

14
00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:21.310
Enter your website, and Centaur reads it and drafts the answers it can find, with a link to each source.

15
00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:29.020
Then work through eight short steps: your pitch, your customers, your competitors and the objections you hear.

16
00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:35.500
Add your main competitors, and Centaur researches each one on the web for a sourced battle card.

17
00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:38.830
You approve every card before the agents use it.

18
00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:45.690
Then add your products and check your pipeline stages, so deal values and forecasts are right from day one.

19
00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:52.820
Set each rep's manager. If a rep's AI drafts wait too long, their manager is copied in.

20
00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:57.180
Next, bring in your accounts, contacts and leads.

21
00:01:57.560 --> 00:02:01.730
Download the Excel template, or use the spreadsheets you already have.

22
00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:09.970
Centaur matches your columns, checks every row before anything is saved, and creates custom fields for anything that doesn't fit.

23
00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:13.310
During the beta, we'll help you on a Teams call.

24
00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:21.620
Finally, review your AI agent settings: the agent's name and sign-off, its guardrails and follow-ups.

25
00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:27.550
The agents start in draft mode, and you decide when, and whether, they send on their own.

26
00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:31.420
You can also connect Slack, for alerts and approvals.

27
00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:34.810
Then each rep does three quick steps of their own.

28
00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:41.120
Connect your mailbox and calendar, so the AI sends from your own account and books meetings for you.

29
00:02:41.740 --> 00:02:47.360
Set your time zone, working hours and tone, so it offers the right times and sounds like you.

30
00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:50.800
And choose how you'd like to be told when a draft needs you.

31
00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:59.620
And that's it. Once every step is ticked, the checklist steps aside, and your day starts here, with your agents already at work.

32
00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:02.150
Centaur CRM.

33
00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:05.500
Set up in a day, selling more from day one.

34
00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:10.010
Book a demonstration today, at centaurcrm.com.
